@startuml 5g-packet-private
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
title 5G Core: детальная схема управления конфигурацией и QoS

actor "OSS/BSS\ncatalog, tariffs,\nenterprise SLA" as OSS
actor "Application Function\nIMS, gaming, enterprise app" as APP
database "UDR/UDM\nsubscriber data,\nDNN, S-NSSAI,\nAMBR, URSP" as UDM
database "PCF policy store\nrules, groups,\nQoS templates" as PSTORE
rectangle "PCF\nPolicy Control Function" as PCF
rectangle "SMF\nSession Management" as SMF
rectangle "AMF\nauth/access context" as AMF
rectangle "gNB\nRAN QoS enforcement" as GNB
rectangle "UPF\nUser Plane Function" as UPF
cloud "Data Network" as DN

OSS --> UDM : provision subscriber/slice/DNN
OSS --> PSTORE : create policy groups\npremium, enterprise, voice
APP --> PCF : N5/N33 request\napp-specific QoS
UDM --> SMF : subscription data
PSTORE --> PCF
PCF --> SMF : N7 PCC policy\n5QI, ARP, GFBR/MFBR,\nSession-AMBR, gating
SMF --> AMF : N11 context
AMF --> GNB : N2 QoS profile
SMF --> UPF : N4 rules:\nPDR, FAR, QER, URR
GNB --> UPF : N3 user plane
UPF --> DN : N6 routing,\nDSCP, QoS enforcement

note bottom
В 5G конфигурация распределена:
UDM/UDR хранит подписку, PCF хранит policy,
SMF строит сессию, UPF применяет QoS на N6/N3,
gNB применяет приоритет в радио.
end note
@enduml
